g source image paths.\n\nCloses #1192\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-question-universe-registry.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-text-first-attempt-flow.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-search-ui.test.js --verbose`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true ./node_modules/.bin/eslint src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-question-universe-registry.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-text-first-attempt-flow.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-search-ui.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/content/i18n.js src/pages/paper-workspace/content/mock-data.js src/pages/paper-workspace/pages/SearchPage.jsx src/pages/paper-workspace/runtime/full-beta-question-universe-registry.js src/pages/paper-workspace/runtime/full-beta-text-first-attempt-flow.js src/pages/paper-workspace/runtime/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime.js src/pages/paper-workspace/runtime/v1-student-adapter.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\n## Notes\n\n- Broad W6 Paper Workspace run initially hit the known worktree dependency/Vite resolver issue when using `NODE_PATH`; rerun with the temporary worktree `node_modules` symlink passed for `paper-workspace-characterization`, `paper-workspace-w6-page-runtime-split`, and `paper-workspace-w6-component-layering`.\n- This PR does not approve source visual rights, claim official scoring readiness, claim launch readiness, or mark visual rows as student-display-final.\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T09:30:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T09:52:26Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T09:52:26Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T09:52:26Z","merge_commit_s